quote the 70% and 30% only with the same scope and measurement basis used in the project, and I would not imply that
those figures apply to every workload.
Question 6. A manager asks whether you can deploy today, but testing is incomplete. What
do you do?
INTERVIEW-READY ANSWER
I explain which tests are incomplete, the risk of releasing without them and the impact of delay. I propose the fastest safe
