Question 44. A Pod is Pending for 15 minutes. What do you check?
INTERVIEW-READY ANSWER
I inspect Pod events and scheduler messages. Causes include insufficient CPU or memory, node selectors or affinity with
no match, taints without tolerations, unbound PVCs, quota limits or unavailable nodes. I check nodes, allocatable capacity,
PVCs, quotas and scheduling rules before changing anything.
Question 45. A Pod shows ImagePullBackOff. What do you check?
INTERVIEW-READY ANSWER
I inspect events, verify image name and tag, registry reachability, imagePullSecret, service account, credentials,
repository permissions and rate limits. I correct the image reference or secret and watch the rollout.
